hickness of REMOVED_DATE to 0 5cm  The cavity appears to connect to the external surface through the lacerated area  Multiple fat necrosis and focal white tan and ill defined areas are present on the cut surface  particularly the medial and lateral margins  The specimen is inked with the lateral margin in blue  serially sectioned  with representative sections submitted in D through P from superior to inferior  Resident  HENRY DONG  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Simon Powell  M D  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  RIGHT BREAST RE EXCISION PART B  RIGHT AXILLARY LYMPH NODES   report_end  , Checked.
