ed skin  There is a short stitch designating superior and a long stitch designating lateral  The skin surface contains a REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm defect and a REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm inverted nipple  The anterior margin is inked blue  the posterior margin is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral  Cut surfaces reveal an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 5 5cm defect extending from the mid inferior aspect to the lower outer quadrant  The defect is consistent with a previous biopsy cavity and communicates with the defect on the overlying skin and comes to 1 5cm of the deep margin  The tissue surrounding the defect reveals areas of chalky yellow fat necrosis and dense rubbery tan white fibrous tissue that contains multiple blue domed cysts ranging from 0 2cm to 1 5cm in diameter  The remaining cut surfaces reveal glistening yellow lobulated adipose tissue with interspersed tan pink fibrous tissue  Representative sections are submitted as follows   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Biopsy cavity to include closest deep margin in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and skin surface defect in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Parenchyma away from biopsy cavity  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast   is a 30 x REMOVED_DATE x 5 0cm right simple mastectomy specimen with a stitch designating 12 o clock  The specimen is partially surfaced by REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm elliptical portion of wrinkled tan white skin with a central REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm everted nipple  The anterior margin is inked blue  the posterior margin is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned from lateral to medial  Surfaces reveal diffuse rubbery  lobulated  dense  tan white to pink areas of fibrous tissue that contain multiple blue domed cysts ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 0 8cm  These areas of fibrous tissue come to 1 3cm of the closest posterior margin  No masses are identified  Representative sections are submitte