ived in formalin   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast mass   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm fibroadipose tissue fragment  with a REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm skin ellipse  There is a single stitch designating the inferior and a double stitch designating the medial margins  The specimen is inked as follows  deep black  anterior blue  superior orange  inferior yellow  The specimen is sectioned from lateral to medial to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm ill defined tan firm mass in the posterior inferior portion of the specimen abutting the inferior resection margin  0 1cm from the deep and superior resection margins  approximately 1 0cm from the medial margin  0 6cm from the anterior margin  and greater than 1 5cm from the lateral resection margins  The remaining parenchyma is predominantly yellow and fatty with scant tan fibrosis  The mass is entirely submitted in cassette A F as follows  A medial margin enface  B  with inferior margin  C and D  inferior and anterior margins  E  inferior and deep margins  F  anterior  inferior and deep margins  Resident  QUN DONG  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY   report_end  , Unchecked.
